  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "RTPS: Enable DATA_FRAG reassembly by default",
  "description": "DATA_FRAG reassembly has been available since 2018 but was disabled\nby default. Enable it so endpoint discovery (DATA(w)/DATA(r)) and\nuser data fragments are automatically reassembled without requiring\nmanual preference configuration.\n\nThis can be toggled via Edit → Preferences → Protocols → RTPS →\n\"Enable RTPS reassembly\".\n\nAI-Assisted: yes (Copilot)",
